The complete NEXUS architecture was reviewed across:

- Domain architecture
- AI intelligence
- Task management
- Prediction systems
- Decision systems
- Intervention systems
- Memory
- Personalization
- Learning
- API
- Authentication
- Authorization
- Database abstraction
- Security
- Observability
- Dashboard state
- Presentation layer
- User interface architecture

The final architecture maintains clear separation between
these responsibilities.

